# Review Subagent Gate（Cursor）

叙事：[AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) · [harness_architecture.md](../../docs/harness_architecture.md) · [code-review-deep/SKILL.md](../../skills/code-review-deep/SKILL.md) · [framework_operator_primer.md](../../docs/framework_operator_primer.md)

**Hook 硬约束**

- **my-light**：不硬拦 `REVIEW_GATE`；不注入 spawn-first（model inherit → [subagent-model-inherit.mdc](subagent-model-inherit.mdc)）
- **深度 review**：spawn-first 可数 lane（`general-purpose` / `best-of-n-runner` / `deep-reviewer`，registry `deep_gate_lanes`）；`fork_context=false` 须 JSON 显式；`explore` 不计入
- **窄范围** / 用户禁 subagent：不武装 `review_required`
- **Stop**：`.cursor/hook-state` + `router-rs REVIEW_GATE` / `AG_FOLLOWUP` 单行短码
- review lane **只读**；纯 review 禁止默认改代码/提交（除非用户显式要求）
